*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.bak
*.backup
backups/

.gemini/
.cursorrules

CLAUDE.md

# [GITIGNORE SECTION 13] Web dashboard (built separately)
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.vite/
web/coverage/

# [GITIGNORE SECTION 14] Jupyter (if used for analytics dev)
.ipynb_checkpoints
*.ipynb

